#: scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ac31198176b545ece4971b9dbecadf93165a38df0ec7e11e5a2703e212a1e73
#. default-sha256: 3a96fcdee7d880ad20744086fb4754549effcb00daac496f455a08bec54bdaf3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫When he takes the necklace, Jacopo looks as though he’s on the "
"verge of tears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Quando pega o colar, Jacopo parece que está à beira das "
"lágrimas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 147cb3404838ed492c22190da034df28497e0e443a78405e035ae14650b7b97d
#. default-sha256: 9f3b572acb6c70ee550c27e97f5890484e3d7436d777237aefb8c42085fd6ff5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whether from the pressure of not wanting to lose face, or simply because he’s no longer able "
"to, he doesn’t actually shed any, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seja pela pressão de não querer perder a pose, ou simplesmente porque não é mais capaz, ele "
"não derrama nenhuma, no entanto."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f383e9c5d43b6b29ce0191ce1a6cca261def50381f8d5843ce03c159cc160b04
#. default-sha256: 9ca34d701d6026de5495a8ebea82c9ba548c454009effa435f698f5c2eb691cb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The other two just stand and watch him quietly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Os outros dois apenas ficam parados e o observam em silêncio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0b8d48a60f961bfa4e276be7c7df8c01fd8aacbe2cbe83a65f5a94c9e335124
#. default-sha256: 39724d0fea11e59eebfcf4e685cb089ffd52b1e45c5d96221400813f1a8b2941
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Neither of them saw the vision of his past, but they don’t pry either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nenhum deles viu a visão do seu passado, mas eles também não se intrometem."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6aa17cde2e16bc78d30e6caab5f2381d1e67db202c90d48879346c9061493af
#. default-sha256: 10a19f39e0b872f7f28350465670cf05ed8d25905458a7f93143542aeff3f63f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our exchange was probably sufficient to give them an idea of what happened, even if they "
"don’t know the details."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nossa conversa provavelmente foi suficiente para dar-lhes uma ideia do que aconteceu, mesmo "
"que eles não saibam os detalhes."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92041b94c00c0cb7afec8664a22f67cc3c1c883e37d5a25b533e0ba6ef4ce840
#. default-sha256: 458e90555815cdca0c559bb94768748f6df662cd266844fcb14bb8ab5c777dee
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Clutching the necklace in one hand, Jacopo takes up the head of the procession to the "
"observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Segurando o colar em uma das mãos, Jacopo assume a liderança da procissão em direção à torre "
"de observação."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D
