msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Tem mais alguém aí com ela?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8FE029FB_D592_49EB_9D67_18DFF2710A8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
