msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There couldn’t be. It’s only Morgana."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não pode ser. É só a Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_90CC1DC7_EBA9_415C_975A_E1CCEC9571C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efed31c99e7e2dfc2ef07ae2713811c4627224a7b54fdbc8c6e1d8090e9cb33e
