msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Stay with me, please...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come on, you can’t give up now..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fique comigo, por favor...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vamos lá, você não pode desistir agora..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_313F8C9B_F6AE_4BEA_B463_2C2C77808735
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7a7234e6c095140d1f63199f8ca50e246bc0f9ea49a57628994569307441040
#. default-sha256: 6962ebc57f2a31b6fbdbc0088ee4cb43a74029b3ead2fb709e17eedb8a4bbe5c
